+
+/****************************************************************************
+ * Private Functions
+ ****************************************************************************/
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_PM_EXT0_WAKEUP
+/****************************************************************************
+ * Name: esp_pm_ext0_wakeup_prepare
+ *
+ * Description:
+ *   Configure ext0 gpios to use as wakeup source.
+ *
+ * Input Parameters:
+ *   None
+ *
+ * Returned Value:
+ *   None
+ *
